oTxtEmpirePalace_investigateA_accept3--c0,继续
oTxtEmpirePalace_investigateA_accept3_win--text,最后一条帝国走狗死了。你搜刮他们的尸体，离开星系。
oTxtEmpirePalace_investigateA_accept3_win--c0,继续
